[{"title":"花朝","author":"黄淮","text":"狴犴严扃钥，花朝不见花。\n若无墙外柳，何以识年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"才闻花信通，已觉风力软。\n寸心元自丹，不逐韶光转。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"隆暑启初伏，薰风入虞琴。\n安得播馀响，涤我烦热襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其三","author":"黄淮","text":"见雁忆故乡，闻蛩思织妇。\n笑语是谁家，声逐微风度。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其四","author":"黄淮","text":"急霰透疏棂，寒声杂鸣柝。\n被冷不成眠，夜永愁偏觉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧闷无聊偶诵东方虬昭君怨三绝后二首妙无以加前一首颇伤于怒予因效颦赋三章非敢角胜也聊以见志云耳 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"欲语娇还怯，含颦耻复惊。\n和亲能固敌，妾不爱微生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧闷无聊偶诵东方虬昭君怨三绝后二首妙无以加前一首颇伤于怒予因效颦赋三章非敢角胜也聊以见志云耳 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"马上琵琶语，凄凉不忍听。\n自知缘薄命，谁复恨丹青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧闷无聊偶诵东方虬昭君怨三绝后二首妙无以加前一首颇伤于怒予因效颦赋三章非敢角胜也聊以见志云耳 其三","author":"黄淮","text":"北风号永夕，寒月照穹庐。\n梦里闻天语，褰衣下玉除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡淮","author":"黄淮","text":"客里情怀易感，途中况味偏谙。\n才过淮流数里，人家渐似江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"春去秋来候雁，暮还晨往寒鸦。\n愁至不堪着目，几回搔首长嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"时往时来警铎，半明半灭残灯。\n枕上暂成归梦，觉来愁思偏增。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其三","author":"黄淮","text":"久?行囊羞涩，只从诗债筹量。\n怪杀墙头杨柳，时时摆动愁肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其四","author":"黄淮","text":"夜眠枕冷衾冷，晓起风多雨多。\n墙外槐阴泛绿，方知节近清和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其五","author":"黄淮","text":"抛却青州从事，支开老秃中书。\n空诧狂如杜老，转添渴似相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其六","author":"黄淮","text":"天外音书断绝，床头药裹频添。\n咄咄书空作势，时时觅句掀髯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其七","author":"黄淮","text":"鹤发双亲老矣，蓬头稚子痴然。\n想起心迷似醉，悲来泪下如泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏八首 其八","author":"黄淮","text":"有限青春易过，无情白发偏多。\n此日尚淹尘迹，何时重整渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧四时诗 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"竹外桃花夜雨，风前柳色溪桥。\n某水某丘依旧，此情此意萧条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧四时诗 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"最忆炎天佳致，时来竹坞乘凉。\n锦鲤旋丝银鲙，碧筒醉吸璚浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧四时诗 其三","author":"黄淮","text":"橘柚千林霜日，芙蓉一棹秋波。\n终日心中想像，几回梦里经过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧四时诗 其四","author":"黄淮","text":"罢钓寒江向晚，寻梅雪里初晴。\n同辈年来有几，嗟予老去无成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49789,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"黄淮","text":"今朝才得见征鸿，羁客凄凉意万重。\n数行若到江南去，好写平安向远空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49790,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺中闻雁代妇作","author":"黄淮","text":"朝来出阁上帘钩，目断飞鸿泪暗流。\n自是别离情思剧，不缘秋色解牵愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49791,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻箫","author":"黄淮","text":"一枕凄凉梦未休，忽闻箫管杂歌讴。\n谁知曲里声声思，都是羁人宛转愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49792,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尝蟹","author":"黄淮","text":"故园霜落暮秋时，酒绿橙黄蟹正宜。\n今日持螯仍大嚼，不堪回首起遐思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49793,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又闻箫","author":"黄淮","text":"霜压危檐冷透毡，孤灯耿耿照无眠。\n箫声若解愁人意，应不随风到枕边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49794,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆友二首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"一日相违鄙吝萌，况经三载旷交情。\n可怜回首云泥隔，梦里犹能说旧盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49795,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆友二首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"中年坎壈鬓成丝，惟有忠君志未衰。\n知己相怜今鲍叔，何因执手话襟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49796,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暑雨","author":"黄淮","text":"暑雨连朝未放晴，不堪病体困炎蒸。\n何当置我昆崙顶，两腋清风万壑冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49797,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏中苦热闻立秋将至成绝句催之","author":"黄淮","text":"闻说新秋次第来，先期特地遣诗催。\n要凭严令驱残暑，散作清凉遍九垓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49798,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"黄淮","text":"乌鹊成桥拥翠轩，牛郎今夕会天孙。\n休嗟隔岁佳期少，良会人间有几番。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49799,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋三首 其一","author":"黄淮","text"